OL,3,AHow much is the minimum wage?
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe official minimum rates of pay rose
OL,6,Ffor 2.7 million workers on 1 April.
OL,8,FThe rate for workers aged 21 and over
OL,9,Fis called the National Living Wage,
OL,10,Fwhile those aged 18 to 20 are paid the
OL,11,FNational Minimum Wage.
OL,13,FThe rates apply across the UK.
OL,15,FFrom 1 April 2026, workers over 21 on
OL,16,Fthe National Living Wage are paid
OL,17,F#12.71 an hour, 50p more than in 2025.
